@CampusFacilities.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5138

### Health check
GET {{CampusFacilities.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List buildings
GET {{CampusFacilities.Api_HostAddress}}/api/buildings
Accept: application/json

### Create a building
POST {{CampusFacilities.Api_HostAddress}}/api/buildings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Library Block",
  "code": "LIB"
}

### List rooms in a building
GET {{CampusFacilities.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rooms?buildingId=1
Accept: application/json
